Colin McCabe created KAFKA-18138:
------------------------------------

             Summary: The controller must add all extant brokers to BrokerHeartbeatTracker when activating
                 Key: KAFKA-18138
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18138
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Colin McCabe
            Assignee: Colin McCabe


The controller must add all extant brokers to BrokerHeartbeatTracker when activating. Otherwise, we could end up in a situation where a broker fails exactly as a controller failover occurs, and we never fence it.



--
