Hi all,

When implementing ConsumerGroupDescribeResponse, we change IsClassic =
field from bool to int8. The field is introduced by RPC version 1. The =
default value =E2=80=9Cfalse=E2=80=9D is equivocal, because it means =
unknown or not a classic member. The client side has to distinguish it =
by RPC version. To fix this, we change it to int8 and use -1 as default =
value for unknown. 0 for consumer member and +1 for classic member.

We also change MemberDescription#isClassic from boolean to =
Optional<Boolean>, so we can use Optional.empty() for unknown case.

