I've opened a pull request to improve the Kafka README file:

https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18027

This PR addresses KAFKA-18111 =
<https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18111>
The main changes include:

Adding the official Kafka logo
Reorganizing the table of contents for better clarity and easy to =
navigate for audience
Please take a look at the PR when you have a chance and provide your =
feedback. I'm happy to make any further adjustments as needed.

If everything looks good, I'd appreciate it if you could merge it into =
the main branch.



Thanks,

Swikar



