Hi,

I just wanted to give a status update on 3.7.2 release. While working on 
RC0, we found a CVE that needs to be fixed (already fixed in trunk, 3.9, 
and 3.8, so I just need to cherry-pick the commit).

However, some artifacts for RC0 got already published while preparing 
the RC, thus we need to bump the RC number. Just want to avoid confusion 
why I will call for a first vote for RC1 instead of RC0.


-Matthias

