Matthias,

Thanks for running the release.

I did the following steps:

   - Validated the checksums and keys
   - Built from source
   - Ran all the unit tests
   - Spot checked the javadocs
   - Spot checked the documentation
   - Ran the KRaft quickstart
   - Pulled and started the docker image
   - Ran the Kafka Streams quickstart

When I looked over the documentation, I noticed the quickstart (main page
and Kafka Streams) still reference the previous release 3.7.1, but this
isn't enough to block the release, we can do a PR against the kafka-site
repo.

+1(binding)

Regards,
Bill

