nce
> > > out
> > > > > > >> members
> > > > > > >> > >>>> with
> > > > > > >> > >>>>>>>>> an incompatible topology ID.
> > > > > > >> > >>>>>>>>> I think doing 2 is also a good option, but in th=
e end
> > > it
> > > > > comes
> > > > > > >> > >>>> down to
> > > > > > >> > >>>>>>>>> how important we believe topology updates (where=
 the
> > > set
> > > > > of
> > > > > > >> > >>>>>>>>> sub-topologies or set of internal topics are
> > > affected) to
> > > > > be.
