4ed7dceb/core/src/main/java/kafka/server/share/SharePartition.java#L1649
> [1] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/share/src/main/java/org/ap=
ache/kafka/server/share/persister/PersisterStateManager.java#L80
> [2] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/core/src/main/java/kafka/s=
erver/share/SharePartition.java#L665
> [3] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/core/src/main/java/kafka/s=
erver/share/SharePartition.java#L646
> [4] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/core/src/main/java/kafka/s=
erver/share/SharePartition.java#L1663



