>  # {{AsyncKafkaConsumerDelegate}}
> There are conditions defined by KIP-848 that determine client eligibility to use the new protocol. This will be modeled by the {{{}GroupProtocolResolver{}}}.
> Known tasks:
>  * Determine at what point in the {{Consumer}} initialization the network communication should happen
>  * Determine what RPCs to invoke in order to determine eligibility (API versions, IBP version, etc.)
>  * Implement the network client lifecycle (startup, communication, shutdown, etc.)
>  * Determine the fall-back path in case the client is not eligible to use the protocol



