-----------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.0.0
       Resolution: Duplicate

> Upgrade to rocksdb 8.x+ (ideally 9.x)
> -------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-18204
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18204
