>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> different than the
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> default/global DLQ, then the user will need to make sure
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> to have created
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> this themselves up front.
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> That's it from me...sorry for the long response, it's
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> just because I'm
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> excited for this feature and have been waiting on a KIP
