>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> the context of a
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> specific task. And when I said earlier that the
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> RecordCollector sits at
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> the "end" of the topology, I meant that it's literally
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> outside the task's
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> subtopology and is used/shared by all tasks on that
