>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> begin with, there's no guarantee what will actually be
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> returned for
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> essential methods such as the new #rawSourceKey/Value or
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> the existing
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> #recordMetadata
