Hi Olasoji,

I think that having a way to provide some optimised/accelerated
implementation is a good idea.
What not using the ServiceLoader feature of Java? That would allow anyone
to provide their own optimised implementation depending on their
infrastructure. We can keep the existing implementation as the default and
allow Kafka to find a better implementation based on Service found. As you
mentioned, we might need to enrich the interface to allow Kafka to find the
best version available at runtime.

Regards,

