>> enum in ProductionExceptionHandler interface. This would require 
>> adding package names to distinguish it.
>> To avoid confusion, I propose renaming it to:
>>       *   ProductionExceptionResponse
>>       *   DeserializationExceptionResponse
>>       *   ProcessingExceptionResponse
>>    3.
>> I also propose nesting the class into the interface, as it is done for 
>> enums.
>>
>> cheers !
>>
>> Sébastien
