Hi,

I'm following this discussion thread. I may have more comments later,
but for now - with KIP-1071 being accepted, could we just include the
updates to KIP-1071 in this KIP? They'd be mostly identical, except
that we don't have to use tagged versions, because no version of the
records were released yet with AK.

Thanks for working on this!

Lucas

