>>>> interfaces are always static). Would you consider adding an overload
>>>> of `handle` instead that passes a collection of DLQ records that can
>>>> be mutated? That wouldn't be as clean as returning it in the return
>>>> value, but would be correct and easy to implement. Needs a good
>>>> Javadoc comment though!
