Hi everyone,

During implementation of KIP-1020, we found that SessionWindowedDe/Serializer
also use `windowed.inner.class.serde`. I update the KIP to introduce
`windowed.inner.serializer.class` to SessionWindowedSerializer and
`windowed.inner.deserializer.class` to SessionWindowedDeserializer.

Thanks,
PoAn

