xception: Unauthorized (Service: null; Status Code: 401; Error Code: null; =
Request ID: null; Proxy: null)]) occurred when evaluating SASL token receiv=
ed from the Kafka Broker. Kafka Client will go to AUTHENTICATION_FAILED sta=
te.",
